msgid "=== \"A3 series with DSpark\""
msgstr "=== \"带DSpark的A3系列\""

msgid ""
"Use the official `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` checkpoint on both nodes. The "
"example keeps the existing DP2/TP16 topology and changes only the DSpark-"
"related and required runtime parameters."
msgstr ""
"在两个节点上使用官方`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8`检查点。该示例保持现有的DP2/TP16拓扑，仅更改与DSpark相关的和必需的运行时参数。"

msgid ""
"Use the same environment variables and command as Node0, with the following "
"DP changes:"
msgstr "使用与Node0相同的环境变量和命令，并进行以下DP更改："

msgid ""
"- `--data-parallel-size` sets the global number of data parallel ranks, and `--data-parallel-size-local` sets the number of DP ranks on the current node.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank` specifies the starting data parallel rank of the current node. Each node must be set to a unique value (e.g., Node0 = 0, Node1 = 1).\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address` specifies the IP address of the data parallel master node (Node0). It must be consistent across all nodes.\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port` is the DP RPC port. Use the same value on all nodes and ensure the port is available.\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size` sets the tensor parallel size within each DP rank. Configure it together with the DP sizes according to the deployment topology and available NPUs.\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for MoE layers. Do not mix MoE tensor parallelism and expert parallelism in the same MoE layer.\n"
"- `--headless` (used on non-master nodes) disables the API server on the node, since only the master node serves requests.\n"
"- `--max-model-len` specifies the maximum context length. Adjust it according to your actual scenario.\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs` indicates the maximum number of requests that each DP group is allowed to process. If the number of requests sent to the service exceeds this limit, the excess requests will remain in a waiting state and will not be scheduled. Note that the time spent in the waiting state is also counted in metrics such as TTFT and TPOT. Therefore, when testing performance, it is generally recommended that `--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= the actual total concurrency.\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens` is the maximum number of tokens processed in one scheduler step. A larger value can improve prefill efficiency but consumes more activation memory.\n"
"- `--tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4`, `--tool-call-parser deepseek_v4`, `--enable-auto-tool-choice`, and `--reasoning-parser deepseek_v4` enable the DeepSeek-V4 tokenizer behavior, automatic tool calling, and reasoning-output parsing.\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching` indicates that prefix caching is disabled. To enable it, remove this option.\n"
"- `--block-size` sets the KV cache block size. To enable the experimental 4K prefix cache hit support, change it from `128` to `32`.\n"
"- `--quantization ascend` enables Ascend quantization for the W4A8 model.\n"
"- `--model-loader-extra-config='{\"enable_multithread_load\": true, \"num_threads\": 128}'` selects the multi-thread weight iterator. `enable_multithread_load` must be a JSON boolean and `num_threads` must be a positive integer.\n"
"- `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch` is an alternative that warms checkpoint files into the OS page cache before the normal iterator loads them. Do not combine it with multi-thread loading: the default loader rejects `prefetch`, `eager`, or `torchao` when `enable_multithread_load` is `true`. The examples in this document use only multi-thread loading.\n"
"- `--speculative-config` configures speculative decoding. Use `mtp` for the preview MTP checkpoint and `dspark` for `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8`. For DSpark, use the value declared by the checkpoint; the example uses five speculative tokens, and all ranks must use the same value.\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'` enables full ACL graph execution in the decode phase to reduce scheduling latency.\n"
"- `--additional-config` enables Ascend-specific optimizations. `enable_npugraph_ex` enables enhanced ACL graph execution, `enable_static_kernel: false` keeps static-kernel compilation disabled, `enable_cpu_binding` enables Ascend-native CPU binding, `enable_shared_expert_dp` enables data parallelism for shared experts, and `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` overlaps shared expert computation for better MoE throughput.\n"
"- `enable_flashcomm1: true` in `--additional-config` enables the FlashComm1 communication optimization. This is the recommended replacement for the deprecated `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1` environment variable. Configure it explicitly whenever `enable_dsa_cp` is enabled.\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL=4096` retains prefix-cache checkpoints every 4096 tokens. It takes effect only when prefix caching is enabled and must be a non-negative multiple of `--block-size`; `4096` matches the DSpark example's block size of `32`."
msgstr ""
"- `--data-parallel-size`设置全局数据并行秩的数量，`--data-parallel-size-local`设置当前节点上的DP秩数量。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-start-rank`指定当前节点的起始数据并行秩。每个节点必须设置为唯一值（例如，Node0 = 0，Node1 = 1）。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-address`指定数据并行主节点（Node0）的IP地址。所有节点必须保持一致。\n"
"- `--data-parallel-rpc-port`是DP RPC端口。在所有节点上使用相同的值，并确保端口可用。\n"
"- `--tensor-parallel-size`设置每个DP秩内的张量并行大小。根据部署拓扑和可用NPU，与DP大小一起配置。\n"
"- `--enable-expert-parallel`为MoE层启用专家并行。不要在同一个MoE层中混合使用MoE张量并行和专家并行。\n"
"- `--headless`（用于非主节点）禁用节点上的API服务器，因为只有主节点提供服务请求。\n"
"- `--max-model-len`指定最大上下文长度。根据实际场景进行调整。\n"
"- `--max-num-seqs`表示每个DP组允许处理的最大请求数。如果发送到服务的请求数超过此限制，多余的请求将保持等待状态，不会被调度。请注意，等待状态所花费的时间也会计入TTFT和TPOT等指标中。因此，在进行性能测试时，通常建议`--max-num-seqs` * `--data-parallel-size` >= 实际总并发数。\n"
"- `--max-num-batched-tokens`是单个调度步骤中处理的最大令牌数。较大的值可以提高预填充效率，但会消耗更多的激活内存。\n"
"- `--tokenizer-mode deepseek_v4`、`--tool-call-parser deepseek_v4`、`--enable-auto-tool-choice`和`--reasoning-parser deepseek_v4`启用DeepSeek-V4分词器行为、自动工具调用和推理输出解析。\n"
"- `--no-enable-prefix-caching`表示禁用前缀缓存。要启用它，请移除该选项。\n"
"- `--block-size`设置KV缓存块大小。要启用实验性的4K前缀缓存命中支持，请将其从`128`更改为`32`。\n"
"- `--quantization ascend`为W4A8模型启用Ascend量化。\n"
"- `--model-loader-extra-config='{\"enable_multithread_load\": true, \"num_threads\": 128}'`选择多线程权重迭代器。`enable_multithread_load`必须是JSON布尔值，`num_threads`必须是正整数。\n"
"- `--safetensors-load-strategy prefetch`是一种替代方案，在正常迭代器加载检查点文件之前，将其预热到操作系统页面缓存中。不要将其与多线程加载结合使用：当`enable_multithread_load`为`true`时，默认加载器会拒绝`prefetch`、`eager`或`torchao`。本文档中的示例仅使用多线程加载。\n"
"- `--speculative-config`配置推测解码。对于预览版MTP检查点使用`mtp`，对于`DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8`使用`dspark`。对于DSpark，使用检查点声明的值；示例使用五个推测令牌，所有秩必须使用相同的值。\n"
"- `--compilation-config '{\"cudagraph_mode\":\"FULL_DECODE_ONLY\"}'`在解码阶段启用完整的ACL图执行，以减少调度延迟。\n"
"- `--additional-config`启用Ascend特定的优化。`enable_npugraph_ex`启用增强的ACL图执行，`enable_static_kernel: false`保持静态内核编译禁用，`enable_cpu_binding`启用Ascend原生CPU绑定，`enable_shared_expert_dp`为共享专家启用数据并行，`multistream_overlap_shared_expert`重叠共享专家计算以提高MoE吞吐量。\n"
"- `--additional-config`中的`enable_flashcomm1: true`启用FlashComm1通信优化。这是已弃用的`VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FLASHCOMM1`环境变量的推荐替代方案。每当启用`enable_dsa_cp`时，请显式配置它。\n"
"- `VLLM_PREFIX_CACHE_RETENTION_INTERVAL=4096`每4096个令牌保留前缀缓存检查点。它仅在启用前缀缓存时生效，并且必须是`--block-size`的非负倍数；`4096`与DSpark示例中`32`的块大小匹配。"

msgid ""
"Common Issues Tip: If you encounter issues, please refer to the [Public "
"FAQs](../../faqs.md) for troubleshooting."
msgstr "常见问题提示：如果遇到问题，请参阅[公共FAQ](../../faqs.md)进行故障排除。"

msgid ""
"The following sections describe PD separation deployment on both Atlas 800 "
"A3 (128GB × 8) and Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8) multi-node environments."
msgstr ""
"以下章节描述了在 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）和 Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）多节点环境下的PD分离部署。"

msgid ""
"This section shows a deployment with one Prefill pool and one Decode pool on"
" Atlas 800 A3 (128GB × 8). The example uses two physical nodes for each "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"本节展示了在 Atlas 800 A3（128GB × 8）上使用一个 Prefill 池和一个 Decode "
"池的部署示例。该示例为每个池使用两个物理节点。"

msgid ""
"2. Select one of the following configurations and prepare "
"`run_dp_template.sh` on each node."
msgstr "2. 选择以下配置之一，并在每个节点上准备 `run_dp_template.sh`。"

msgid "=== \"A3 series with MTP\""
msgstr "=== \"A3系列与MTP\""

msgid ""
"Both Prefill nodes use the same template. Set `local_ip` to the IP address "
"of the current node."
msgstr "两个 Prefill 节点使用相同的模板。将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP 地址。"

msgid "**Prefill nodes**"
msgstr "**Prefill 节点**"

msgid ""
"Both Decode nodes also use one shared template. Set `local_ip` to the IP "
"address of the current node."
msgstr "两个 Decode 节点也使用一个共享模板。将 `local_ip` 设置为当前节点的 IP 地址。"

msgid "**Decode nodes**"
msgstr "**Decode 节点**"

msgid ""
"Start the two Prefill nodes and two Decode nodes. The two Prefill commands "
"are both required because each node owns a different DP rank range."
msgstr ""
"启动两个 Prefill 节点和两个 Decode 节点。两个 Prefill 命令都是必需的，因为每个节点拥有不同的 DP rank 范围。"

msgid ""
"The official `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` checkpoint supports DSpark without "
"a separate draft-model path. Reuse `launch_online_dp.py` above and use the "
"following role-specific templates."
msgstr ""
"官方 `DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8` 检查点支持 DSpark，无需单独的草稿模型路径。复用上述 "
"`launch_online_dp.py`，并使用以下按角色区分的模板。"

msgid ""
"Start the two Prefill nodes and two Decode nodes. Replace the addresses with"
" the Prefill and Decode master-node IPs respectively."
msgstr "启动两个 Prefill 节点和两个 Decode 节点。将地址分别替换为 Prefill 和 Decode 主节点的 IP。"

msgid "3. Deploy the P-D disaggregation proxy."
msgstr "3. 部署 P-D 分离代理。"

msgid ""
"This section shows a deployment with one Prefill pool and one Decode pool on"
" Atlas 800 A2 (64GB × 8). The example uses four physical nodes for each "
"pool."
msgstr ""
"本节展示了在 Atlas 800 A2（64GB × 8）上使用一个 Prefill 池和一个 Decode "
"池的部署示例。该示例为每个池使用四个物理节点。"

msgid "=== \"A2 series with dspark\""
msgstr "=== \"A2系列与dspark\""

msgid ""
"For each P instance, only these two configuration values need to be "
"modified: `kv_port` and `engine_id`. The `engine_id` should start from 0 and"
" increment sequentially, while the `kv_port` (e.g., `30100`) must be unique "
"for each P instance, such as 30000, 30100, etc."
msgstr ""
"对于每个 P 实例，只需修改以下两个配置值：`kv_port` 和 `engine_id`。`engine_id` 应从 0 开始并依次递增，而 "
"`kv_port`（例如 `30100`）对于每个 P 实例必须是唯一的，例如 30000、30100 等。"

msgid ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` keeps the hybrid KV cache manager enabled. DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool deployments require this flag; otherwise, the service may OOM during startup.\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` forces eager execution on prefill nodes instead of graph compilation.\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` allows the model repository's custom code to be loaded. Only use trusted model repositories.\n"
"- `enable_dsa_cp: true` enables DSA context parallelism on Prefill nodes. DSA-CP depends on FlashComm1, so the same `--additional-config` object must also set `\"enable_flashcomm1\": true`.\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` configures KV cache transfer between the prefill producer and decode consumer in PD separation.\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` and `decode.dp_size/tp_size` must match the actual global DP and TP layout on the prefill and decode sides.\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`: enables the Fused MC2 fusion operator to accelerate communication on prefill nodes (A3 series).\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`: enables the recomputation scheduler. When the KV Cache of the Decode node is insufficient, requests are sent to Prefill for KV Cache recomputation. Enable it only on PD Decode nodes; the legacy top-level key is deprecated.\n"
"- `--speculative-config`: Prefill and Decode must use the same DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` value. Use the value declared by the checkpoint; this example uses `5`. The nested `enforce_eager` applies to DSpark draft execution, while the top-level `--enforce-eager` keeps the Prefill target model in eager mode.\n"
"- `MooncakeHybridConnector`: the KV transfer connector used for PD separation, transferring KV Cache between prefill and decode nodes."
msgstr ""
"- `--no-disable-hybrid-kv-cache-manager` 保持混合 KV 缓存管理器处于启用状态。DeepSeek-V4 KV Pool 部署需要此标志；否则，服务在启动期间可能会发生 OOM。\n"
"- `--enforce-eager` 在 prefill 节点上强制执行 eager 模式，而非图编译。\n"
"- `--trust-remote-code` 允许加载模型仓库的自定义代码。仅使用受信任的模型仓库。\n"
"- `enable_dsa_cp: true` 在 Prefill 节点上启用 DSA 上下文并行。DSA-CP 依赖 FlashComm1，因此同一个 `--additional-config` 对象还必须设置 `\"enable_flashcomm1\": true`。\n"
"- `--kv-transfer-config` 配置 PD 分离中 prefill 生产者与 decode 消费者之间的 KV 缓存传输。\n"
"- `kv_connector_extra_config.prefill.dp_size/tp_size` 和 `decode.dp_size/tp_size` 必须与 prefill 和 decode 侧的实际全局 DP 和 TP 布局一致。\n"
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_FUSED_MC2=1`：启用 Fused MC2 融合算子以加速 prefill 节点（A3 系列）上的通信。\n"
"- `scheduler_config.recompute_scheduler_enable: true`：启用重计算调度器。当 Decode 节点的 KV Cache 不足时，请求会被发送到 Prefill 进行 KV Cache 重计算。仅在 PD Decode 节点上启用；旧的顶层键已弃用。\n"
"- `--speculative-config`：Prefill 和 Decode 必须使用相同的 DSpark `num_speculative_tokens` 值。使用检查点声明的值；本示例使用 `5`。嵌套的 `enforce_eager` 适用于 DSpark 草稿执行，而顶层 `--enforce-eager` 使 Prefill 目标模型保持 eager 模式。\n"
"- `MooncakeHybridConnector`：用于 PD 分离的 KV 传输连接器，在 prefill 和 decode 节点之间传输 KV Cache。"

