msgstr "常见问题提示：如果在 PD 分离部署中遇到问题，请参阅[公共FAQ](../../faqs.md)进行故障排查。"

msgid ""
"Refer to [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/) for "
"more details."
msgstr ""
"更多详细信息，请参阅 [vllm benchmark](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/benchmarking/)。"

msgid ""
"> **Note**: The following configurations are based on the Chapter 5 "
"deployment examples and specific test environments. They are for reference "
"only and are not globally optimal. In particular, the long-context "
"configuration is a suggested starting point for inputs around 1M tokens and "
"must be validated against the actual input/output length, prefix cache hit "
"rate, concurrency, memory usage, and deployment environment. Refer to "
"Section 9.2 for further tuning."
msgstr ""
"> **注意**：以下配置基于第5章的部署示例和特定测试环境。它们仅供参考，并非全局最优。特别是，长上下文配置是针对约 1M token "
"输入的建议起点，必须根据实际的输入/输出长度、前缀缓存命中率、并发度、内存使用情况和部署环境进行验证。有关进一步调优，请参阅第 9.2 节。"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Deployment Mode | *Total NPUs | Weight Version | Key "
"Considerations |"
msgstr "| 场景 | 部署模式 | *NPU总数 | 权重版本 | 关键考虑因素 |"

msgid ""
"| Short Sequence / High Throughput | 1P1D deployment (2 Prefill + 2 Decode "
"A3 nodes) | 64 (A3) | DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | Compared with the long-"
"context configuration, use higher DP and concurrency: Prefill uses DP4/TP8 "
"with 16 sequences, while Decode uses DP16/TP2 with 8 sequences. Enable "
"FUSED_MC2 on Prefill to prioritize throughput. |"
msgstr ""
"| 短序列 / 高吞吐 | 1P1D 部署（2 个 Prefill + 2 个 Decode A3 节点） | 64 (A3) | "
"DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | 与长上下文配置相比，使用更高的 DP 和并发度：Prefill 使用 DP4/TP8 和 16 "
"个序列，而 Decode 使用 DP16/TP2 和 8 个序列。在 Prefill 上启用 FUSED_MC2 以优先保证吞吐量。 |"

msgid ""
"| Long Context (~1M Input, Reference) | 1P1D deployment (2 Prefill + 2 "
"Decode A3 nodes) | 64 (A3) | DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | Compared with the "
"short-sequence configuration, use DP2/TP16 on both sides, reduce both sides "
"to 2 sequences, and reduce Decode batched tokens to 16 to reserve memory for"
" a 1M-token context. |"
msgstr ""
"| 长上下文（约1M输入，参考） | 1P1D 部署（2 个 Prefill + 2 个 Decode A3 节点） | 64 (A3) | "
"DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-w4a8 | 与短序列配置相比，两侧均使用 DP2/TP16，将两侧的序列数减少到 2，并将 Decode "
"的批处理 token 数减少到 16，以便为 1M token 的上下文预留内存。 |"

msgid ""
"| Scenario | Configuration | NPUs | TP | DP | Max Num Seqs | Max Num Batched"
" Tokens | Max Model Len | DSpark Speculation Num | FUSED_MC2 | EP Switch | "
"FC / DSA-CP Switch |"
msgstr ""
"| 场景 | 配置 | NPU数 | TP | DP | 最大序列数 | 最大批处理Token数 | 最大模型长度 | DSpark投机数 | "
"FUSED_MC2 | EP开关 | FC / DSA-CP开关 |"

msgid ""
"> `FC / DSA-CP Switch` reports the FlashComm1 and DSA context-parallel switches respectively. For the long-context Prefill configuration, set `\"enable_flashcomm1\": true` and `\"enable_dsa_cp\": false` in `--additional-config`. On Decode, configure recomputation as `\"scheduler_config\": {\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}`. Keep the role-specific `--kv-transfer-config` as the final argument, using `\"kv_port\": \"30100\"` and `\"engine_id\": \"1\"` for Prefill, and `\"kv_port\": \"30800\"` and `\"engine_id\": \"8\"` for Decode.\n"
">\n"
"> FUSED_MC2 is disabled in the long-context reference configuration because it increases memory usage. If sufficient memory is available and higher performance is the priority, enabling FUSED_MC2 on Prefill is recommended.\n"
">\n"
"> `--max-model-len 1048576` is the total context budget for prompt and generated tokens, not an additional output budget on top of a 1M-token prompt. Reduce `--max-num-seqs` or the actual input length if memory is insufficient.\n"
">\n"
"> For complete startup commands and parameter descriptions, please refer to the deployment examples in [Chapter 5](#5-online-service-deployment)."
msgstr ""
"> `FC / DSA-CP Switch` 分别报告FlashComm1和DSA上下文并行开关。对于长上下文Prefill配置，在`--additional-config`中设置`\"enable_flashcomm1\": true`和`\"enable_dsa_cp\": false`。在Decode阶段，将重计算配置为`\"scheduler_config\": {\"recompute_scheduler_enable\": true}`。将特定角色的`--kv-transfer-config`作为最后一个参数，Prefill使用`\"kv_port\": \"30100\"`和`\"engine_id\": \"1\"`，Decode使用`\"kv_port\": \"30800\"`和`\"engine_id\": \"8\"`。\n"
">\n"
"> 在长上下文参考配置中禁用了FUSED_MC2，因为它会增加内存使用。如果内存充足且优先考虑更高性能，建议在Prefill上启用FUSED_MC2。\n"
">\n"
"> `--max-model-len 1048576`是提示词和生成token的总上下文预算，不是1M-token提示词之外的额外输出预算。如果内存不足，请减少`--max-num-seqs`或实际输入长度。\n"
">\n"
"> 有关完整的启动命令和参数描述，请参考[第5章](#5-online-service-deployment)中的部署示例。"

